        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WP9BP, 12 Inch Warwick Escutcheon Rough Iron Door Pull with Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn's 12\" Warwick Rough Iron Door Pull mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron. The WP9BP Warwick Escutcheon Rough Iron Door Pull with Grip has decorative forged crests on both the top and the bottom of the plate; and it also features an engraved handle. This door pull is surfaced mounted and can be easily installed with just a few screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/rough-iron-12-inch-warwick-push-plate-acorn-wncbp\"><b>Push Plate</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Warwick Escutcheon Rough Iron Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Texture Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length to Center: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: Square</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application. This door pull is handmade and all dimensions are approximate.</i>\r\n</p>",
